# We Rejoice!

Delhi has recently honoured the radiant nadaswaram musician Thiruvavaduthurai T. N. Rajarathinam and Tamil Professor R. P. Sethu.

It has honoured Rajarathinam, who commands the nation's respect among musicians. It has awarded the professor Rs. 5,000 for his *Tamil Inbam*. These are joyful tidings. Even if they are the result of inner agitation, we truly rejoice that the protests have turned the rulers' attention at least this far.

(*Seithi*, 20-2-22; *Dravida Nadu*)
